├── [scoped @<actor>] asActorRef({ address }) → getOneActorEnrolledByRef({ ref })   [+] asActorRef (PURE) PARSES `@<actor>` (fail-loud on a `@:<clone>` grain) → the anonymous-actor HASH-or-prefix ref (blocker-4: the `<actor>` body IS the hash; enroll mints ONLY hash actors); getOneActorEnrolledByRef (DISK, i006-r11-B1) then matches the hash/prefix → the actor dir: exact hash, or a UNIQUE prefix; an AMBIGUOUS prefix → fail-loud naming candidates + fix, a no-match → fail-loud (a slug scope is the clone dream's, once actors.yml mints slugs)
